          "description": "# Schemas and examples\n\nYou can download the following zipped archive, which contains XML schemas and examples of the request and response payloads for each of the API endpoints:\n\n[Schemas and example messages](/api-documentation/docs/api/download/customs-inventory-linking-exports/1.0/inventory-linking-exports-schemas.zip)\n\nZIP, 3.1MB last updated 17/09/2026\n",
